          <small class="ms-auto">Last updated: 2018-04-30</small>
        </div>
        <div class="ms-md-4">
          <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row justify-content-between">
            <div>
              <strong>Revocable Identity-based Encryption from Codes with Rank Metric</strong>
              <div class="mt-1"><span class="fst-italic">Donghoon Chang, Amit Kumar Chauhan, Sandeep Kumar, Somitra Kumar Sanadhya</span></div>
            </div>
            
          </div>
          <p class="mb-0 mt-1 search-abstract">In this paper, we present an identity-based encryption scheme from codes with efficient key revocation. Recently, in Crypto 2017, Gaborit et al. proposed a first identity-based encryption scheme from codes with rank metric, called RankIBE. To extract the decryption key from any public identity, they constructed a trapdoor function which relies on RankSign, a signature scheme proposed by Gaborit et al. in PQCrypto 2014. We adopt the same trapdoor function to add efficient key revocation...</p>
