          <small class="ms-auto">Last updated: 2017-08-28</small>
        </div>
        <div class="ms-md-4">
          <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row justify-content-between">
            <div>
              <strong>Forward and Backward Private Searchable Encryption from Constrained Cryptographic Primitives</strong>
              <div class="mt-1"><span class="fst-italic">Raphael Bost, Brice Minaud, Olga Ohrimenko</span></div>
